      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790136226957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. It is child class of Map interface .\n\n2. It also doen't allow duplicate key although value can\nbe created .\n\n3. It stores data in BST.\n\n4. Thus when we traverse , always gets output in sorted\norder .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. It is child class of Map interface .\n\n2. It also doen't allow duplicate key although value can be created .\n\n3. It stores data in BST.\n\n4. Thus when we traverse , always gets output in sorted order .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
