        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790142278222,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. HashSet also stores data in HashMap internally . So\nunderstanding HaspMap will help understanding hashSet .\n\n2. HashMap internally uses hash table .\n\nMap <String, Integer> student = new HashMap<>();\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. HashSet also stores data in HashMap internally . So understanding HaspMap will help understanding hashSet .\n\n2. HashMap internally uses hash table .\n\nMap <String, Integer> student = new HashMap<>();\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
